Launch Point and knockback

Launch Point buildup, launch velocity, directional launch, hitstun, bounce mechanics, and ring-outs must remain meaningful.

Never apply ordinary attack steering or movement improvements during forced knockback in a way that cancels the launch.

Hitstun and blockstun

