Energy

Do not unintentionally make Energy meaningless.

Stage hazards

Do not break collision, hazards, moving platforms, disappearing platforms, the Void, or stage boundaries.

CPU fairness

The CPU must use the same underlying physics and legal action rules.

Difficulty should continue to affect decision-making, not grant superior movement capabilities.

Practice Ground

Keep the training dummy, training controls, fighter switching, and hit testing functional.

Determinism

Preserve the 60 Hz deterministic simulation.

Performance

Keep the game lightweight and suitable for browser execution, including mobile devices.

